WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.901
Start at the recordings hub
This is the starting point for teaching session recordings and coaching meetings. Choose the workspace you want to review.

2
00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:16.659
Tutor session recordings
Choose Tutor session recordings to find lectures, recordings and attendance. Browse by calendar date or LMS module.

3
00:00:16.659 --> 00:00:25.866
Open the tutor workspace
Select the tutor card to open the lecture calendar. Search for a lecture, then open its details to review the available evidence.

4
00:00:25.866 --> 00:00:34.367
Coach meetings and recordings
Choose Coach meetings and recordings to review meetings by coach, including available recordings, attendance and quality checks.

5
00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:43.405
Choose a coach first
In the coaching workspace, choose a Coach to load their meeting calendar. The Coach meetings guide explains the next steps.
